# Code Owners for the shared security pipeline.
#
# Everything in this repository is a security control for SIX repositories, so every path
# is owned. Branch protection must have "Require review from Code Owners" enabled, and
# both teams need at least Write access here - GitHub silently ignores an entry whose team
# lacks access, and the control then fails open with no error anywhere.
#
# Two teams on every path: a pull request author never satisfies their own Code Owner
# review, so a single-team path stalls whenever that team is the author.

*                       @neotree/maintainers @neotree/core-devs
/security/              @neotree/maintainers @neotree/core-devs
/.github/workflows/     @neotree/maintainers @neotree/core-devs
/templates/             @neotree/maintainers @neotree/core-devs
